  textBeforeStart:
  - The experiment is being prepared and will start soon. Please wait.
  textBeforeStimuliIntroduction:
  - 'Try to reduce head movements and general body movements to a minimum, this will
    improve the measurements. '
  textStimuliIntroduction:
  - 'You will be looking at a series of highlighted stimuli.  A stimulus is a blue
    sphere. A highlighted stimulus is yellow.  '
  - 'Once you look at a stimulus, it will turn orange. Once you select the stimulus,
    it will turn green, and a confirmation sound plays. '
  - You will be selecting the highlighted stimulus by looking at it and using a pinch
    gesture with your right hand.
  textBeforeExample:
  - 'Try it out. Look at the stimulus in front of you, and pinch to select.  '
  instructionsTestrun1:
  - 
  instructionsTestrun2:
  - 
  instructionsTestrun3:
  - 
  textAfterExample:
  - 'Well done! The experiment contains multiple rounds. During each round, you will
    observe 20 events. '
  - 'Inbetween the rounds you have 20 seconds to relax. During this time you can
    freely move your hand, and rest your eyes. '
  - 'Be sure to return into the original position after relaxing. '
  stimuliPrefab: {fileID: 2297796887684887862, guid: 8fc5897fb280c77459d8e476adda8d51, type: 3}
  gazeRaycaster: {fileID: 1359528791}
